{
  "passage": "Last weekend, on Saturday, 15th October, our school held a charity fair in the main hall to raise money for the local children's hospital. The event started at 10 a.m. and lasted until 4 p.m. We encouraged all students and their families to join, and many volunteered to help. There were several stalls: a bake sale where we sold homemade cakes and cookies at inexpensive prices, a game stall with fun activities, and a raffle. The raffle prize was a weekend trip to Africa, which was donated by a local travel agency. One popular game was a mini motor-racing track where players could switch cars and compete. We also had a photo booth where we could take pictures of ourselves with funny props. By the end of the day, we had raised over 500 pounds, which was fantastic. The event showed how we can work together to make a difference.",
